# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Clock Tower" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Starting out
1	line	Player	Hello monk.
1	line	Brother Kojo	Hello adventurer. My name is Brother Kojo. Do you happen to know the time?
1	line	Player	No, sorry, I don't.
1	line	Brother Kojo	Exactly! This clock tower has recently broken down, and without it nobody can tell the correct time. I must fix it before the town people become too angry!
1	line	Brother Kojo	I don't suppose you could assist me in the repairs? I'll pay you for your help.
1	select	Start the Clock Tower quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	OK old monk, what can I do?
2	line	Brother Kojo	Oh, thank you kindly! In the cellar below, you'll find four cogs. They're too heavy for me, but you should be able to carry them one at a time.
2	line	Brother Kojo	I know one goes on each floor... but I can't exactly remember which goes where specifically. Oh well, I'm sure you can figure it out fairly easily.
2	line	Player	Well, I'll do my best.
2	line	Brother Kojo	Thank you again! And remember to be careful, the cellar is full of strange beasts!
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	Not now old monk.
2	line	Brother Kojo	OK then. Come back and let me know if you change your mind.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Brother Kojo again
1	line	Player	Hello again.
1	line	Brother Kojo	Oh hello, are you having trouble? The cogs are in four rooms below us. Place one cog on a pole on each of the four tower levels.
1	line	Player	Right, gotcha. I'll do that then.
1	action	end
